<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SCP 基金會 - 機密檔案庫</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #0d0d0d;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #b00;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #333;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        /* 這是連結按鈕的樣式 */
        .scp-link {
            display: block;
            background-color: #1a1a1a;
            border: 1px solid #444;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fff;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .scp-link:hover {
            background-color: #2a2a2a;
            border-color: #b00;
            transform: translateX(5px);
        }
        .scp-number {
            color: #b00;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2em;
        }
        .scp-title {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 5px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #aaa;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            font-size: 0.8em;
            color: #555;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>SCP 基金會資料庫</h1>
        
        <!-- 👇 這裡是檔案列表，你可以複製整個 <a>...</a> 區塊來新增更多檔案 -->
        
        <!-- 這是第一篇文章的連結 -->
        <a href="scp-001.html" class="scp-link">
            <span class="scp-number">SCP-001</span>
            <span class="scp-title">點擊查看完整檔案內容</span>
        </a>

        <!-- 未來如果有第二篇，就複製上面這段，把 href 改成 scp-002.html -->

        <div class="footer">
            <p>SECURE. CONTAIN. PROTECT.</p>
            <p>警告：未經授權存取機密檔案將導致立即處決。</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
